OL,3,AWhite House defends new press secretary
OL,4,Aamid questions about her legal
OL,5,Acredentials
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe does not appear to be registered to
OL,8,Fthe bar in any state where she has
OL,9,Flived. White House communications
OL,10,Fdirector Steven Cheung said Zacharia is
OL,11,F"uniquely qualified and whip smart to
OL,12,Fhelp inform the American people".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
